    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-super-clone-chain",
        "moduleId": "scenario-and-super-clone",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材示例：用 super.clone() 补全 clone()",
        "markdown": "教材用一个 `Vehicle` 示例补全 `clone()`：在重写的方法里调用 `super.clone()`。教材把这一步理解为在内存中对对象做一次逐字节复制，对象的字段槽位按原样抄到新对象中。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000093"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Clone Example I"
              ],
              "lineStart": 563,
              "lineEnd": 567,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "116493a6a6ed1994d3a90f155cee6c17ec28d2915a7dbd78d4d5c7a5a365dcd0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-byte-copy",
        "moduleId": "scenario-and-super-clone",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：逐字节复制到底复制了什么",
        "markdown": "逐字节复制只保证字段槽位相同，并不区分槽位里存的是数值还是引用。若 `Vehicle` 有一个 `int age` 和一个引用字段，复制后新对象的 `age` 是独立数值，而引用字段只是又一个指向同一目标对象的指针。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-super-clone-chain"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-shallow-boundary",
        "moduleId": "shallow-copy-fields",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材结论：这一步只得到浅拷贝",
        "markdown": "教材由此给出结论：基本类型（例如 `age`）会被复制；引用也会被复制，但引用所指向的对象不会被复制。因此仅靠 `super.clone()` 得到的仍然是 shallow copy。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000093"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Clone Example I"
              ],
              "lineStart": 563,
              "lineEnd": 567,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "116493a6a6ed1994d3a90f155cee6c17ec28d2915a7dbd78d4d5c7a5a365dcd0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-field-outcome-table",
        "moduleId": "shallow-copy-fields",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "补充：复制后每个字段的实际状态",
        "markdown": "把教材的结论按字段类别展开，可以直接看出共享关系落在哪里：\n\n| 字段类别 | `super.clone()` 之后 | 与原对象是否隔离 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 基本类型，如 `age` | 数值被抄进新对象的字段槽位 | 是，修改互不影响 |\n| 引用字段，如成员 `Velocity` | 引用值被抄，仍指向同一个成员对象 | 否，两个 `Vehicle` 共享同一成员对象 |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-shallow-boundary"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-deep-recipe",
        "moduleId": "deep-clone-recipe",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材要求：深拷贝要继续克隆被引用对象",
        "markdown": "教材指出，deep clone 需要克隆被引用的对象，而这些对象又要克隆它们自己引用的对象，如此逐层进行。示例中的做法是让被引用的 `Velocity` 可克隆，并确保 `Vehicle` 的该成员变量在复制过程中被显式克隆。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000093"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Clone Example I"
              ],
              "lineStart": 563,
              "lineEnd": 567,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "116493a6a6ed1994d3a90f155cee6c17ec28d2915a7dbd78d4d5c7a5a365dcd0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-deep-clone-code",
        "moduleId": "deep-clone-recipe",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "补充：按教材要求写出的实现骨架",
        "markdown": "下面的骨架把教材的两步要求落成代码：成员类型自己实现 `clone()`，外层在 `super.clone()` 之后补上一次显式克隆。\n\n```java\nclass Velocity implements Cloneable {\n    int dx;\n    int dy;\n\n    @Override\n    public Velocity clone() {\n        try {\n            return (Velocity) super.clone();\n        } catch (CloneNotSupportedException e) {\n            throw new AssertionError(e);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nclass Vehicle implements Cloneable {\n    int age;\n    Velocity velocity;\n\n    @Override\n    public Vehicle clone() {\n        try {\n            Vehicle copy = (Vehicle) super.clone();\n            copy.velocity = this.velocity.clone();\n            return copy;\n        } catch (CloneNotSupportedException e) {\n            throw new AssertionError(e);\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n`Velocity` 若自身还持有引用字段，它的 `clone()` 也必须同样补上克隆步骤，递归链条才能闭合。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-deep-recipe"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-check",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "检查清单：这是浅拷贝还是深拷贝",
        "markdown": "对一个重写了 `clone()` 的类依次核对：\n\n1. 该类是否实现了 `Cloneable`，否则调用 `clone()` 会失败。\n2. 每个引用字段是否在 `clone()` 中单独克隆，而不是直接沿用 `super.clone()` 抄来的引用。\n3. 成员对象的 `clone()` 是否也处理了它自己引用的对象。\n\n缺少第 2 步时，得到的是浅拷贝：两个对象共享同一个成员对象，修改任一侧都会影响另一侧。只有第 2、3 步都成立，才与教材所说的递归深拷贝一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-deep-recipe",
            "model-deep-clone-code"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-bridge",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "迁移：同样的判断适用于数组字段",
        "markdown": "这条边界并不只针对普通对象。数组字段同样可以被复制引用而共享元素，判断依据与上表完全一致：先问数组对象本身是否被复制，再问元素对象是否也被复制。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-field-outcome-table",
            "model-check"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
